  "solution": "**Given :**\n\nA = k(B + 18), A = 108, B = 36\n\n**Calculation : **\n\n⇒ A = k(B + 18)\n\n⇒ 108 = k(36 + 18)\n\n⇒ k = 108/54 = 2\n\nA = 2 × (68 + 18)\n\n⇒ 2 × 86 = 172\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 172.**",
